<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How DesignTested earns money and how that affects our reviews.">
  <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
  <p>DesignTested participates in affiliate programs. When you click some links on this site and then buy or subscribe, we may earn a commission from the vendor. It costs you nothing extra and in some cases you get a discount or an extended trial.</p>
  <h2>What this means for our content</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Commissions do not decide which product we recommend or how we score it. The scoring criteria are on the <a href="/how-we-test/">How we test</a> page.</li>
    <li>We write negative things about products that pay us, and we recommend products that do not.</li>
    <li>Affiliate links are marked, and each article carries a disclosure near the top.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Our own product</h2>
  <p>People connected with this site also work on Desenta, a white-label software product for interior designers. We label it clearly as our own product wherever it appears.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>We may show advertising in the future. Advertisers do not get influence over editorial content.</p>
  <p>Questions? <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
</Base>
